      "comments": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50048522",
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how distilling collective intelligence from multi-agent systems enables recursive self-improvement beyond human supervision. You will learn how models can serve as their own optimizers and evaluators on complex frontier tasks.",
      "authors": [
        "Hyunin Lee",
